        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Zohra Lampert, Elia Kazan, Natalie Wood, Warren Beatty\n- Works: Splendor in the Grass\n- Organizations: The New York Times\n\nFacts:\n- Splendor in the Grass is a 1961 movie starring Zohra Lampert, Elia Kazan, Natalie Wood, and Warren Beatty.\n- Elia Kazan directed Splendor in the Grass.\n- The New York Times described Elia Kazan as \"one of the most honored and influential directors in Broadway and Hollywood history.\"\n- Elia Kazan was Greek-American.",
